  "result": "All of that is already done. Current state:\n\n- **Hrefs**: `notification-service.ts` has `issueHref()` using `issuePath`/`settingsPath` from `src/lib/url.ts`; `search-service.ts` has an async `hrefFor()` using `issuePath`/`projectPath`/`orgPath`.\n- **`issue.status_changed` subscriber**: added, notifies the assignee, skips self-changes and unassigned issues.\n- **`billing.limit_exceeded` subscriber**: added, notifies owners via `memberRepo.listActiveOwnerIds`, deduped by unread body-text match until read.\n- **`member.joined`**: now notifies `listActiveOwnerIds(orgId)` instead of the joining user.\n- **Assignment-at-creation**: `issue-service.ts` `createIssue` now emits `issue.assigned` when `assigneeId` is set at creation.\n- **Owner-listing**: added `listActiveOwnerIds` to `member-repository.ts` and used it everywhere above.\n\nVerified with `npm run typecheck` (clean) and `npm test` (617/617 passing, after correcting two tests that had encoded the old insecure/buggy behavior). Nothing further to do here unless you want something adjusted.",
